      "hints": [
        "Differentiate $\\frac{dV}{dh} = \\frac{1}{3}\\pi(225 - 3h^2) = \\pi(75 - h^2)$.",
        "Solve $\\frac{dV}{dh} = 0 \\implies h = 5\\sqrt{3}\\text{ cm}$.",
        "Show $\\frac{d^2V}{dh^2} = -2\\pi h < 0$ for a maximum."
